<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <div class="faq-hdr">
      <p class="sec-label">Got Questions?</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">WE HAVE ANSWERS.</h2>
    </div>
    <details>
      <summary>How are donations used to support veterans?</summary>
      <p>
        Your contributions fund Warrior Retreats, Marriage Retreats, Peer-to-Peer support, the AV
        Ambassador Program, Operation Christmas Elf, temporary housing, and direct assistance for
        utilities, food, vehicle repairs, clothing, and VA benefit navigation.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Are donations tax-deductible?</summary>
      <p>
        Yes. All donations to Alabama Veteran are fully tax-deductible. You will receive an official
        receipt immediately after your contribution. Corporate sponsors also receive an annual
        acknowledgment letter for CSR reporting. Our 990s are publicly available at
        alabamaveteran.org.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What do corporate sponsors receive?</summary>
      <p>
        Depending on your tier, you receive logo placement on our website and at events, the
        official Proud Supporter badge and full brand package, social media recognition, named
        program sponsorships, press announcements, employee engagement opportunities, and more. Full
        details are listed in each tier above.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can my employees get involved too?</summary>
      <p>
        Absolutely. Titan Society and Champions League members receive employee engagement packages
        including volunteering at events, attending Warrior Retreats as supporters, and
        participating in fundraising campaigns. Contact us to build a custom program for your
        company.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Is there a minimum donation amount?</summary>
      <p>
        For individual supporters there is no minimum. Corporate tiers start at $250 per month. For
        custom packages, contact us at info@alabamaveteran.org and we will build something that
        works for your organization.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>How does Alabama Veteran ensure transparency?</summary>
      <p>
        Approved financial disclosures are published through the organization’s public filing links.
        Program-allocation claims must be verified before publication.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
